# Lecture 4

### Side Units and Resources

---

## Side Bars

- Side bars frame supplementary content
- Equivalent to a unit, but displayed in a sidebar
- Folder name starts with `side-`

---

## Typical Usage

- Labs associated with a topic
- Additional reading material
- Problem sheets and exercises

---

## Summary

Side bars provide a flexible way to organise supporting resources alongside your main content.
